      <div type="clause" n="19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 19</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Cliroc feowra sum hine clænsie his heafodgemacene, ⁊ ane his hand on wiofode; oþre ætstanden aþ abycgan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A cleric should clear himself as one of four of his equals, and his hand alone on the altar; the others should stand by to validate the oath.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Cliroc feowra sum hine clænsie his heafodgemacene ⁊ ane his hand on wiofode; oþre ætstanden, aþ abycgan.</ab>
